    r(r'\emph{schéma de Néron--Severi}',r'\uline{schéma de Néron-Severi}','Néron-Severi name','The phrase is straight underlined and the compound has a short hyphen.')
    r(r'$G^\circ_{\mathrm{réd}}$ est un sous-schéma',r'$G_{\mathrm{réd}}$ est un sous-schéma','first reduced-group name','The print omits the identity-component superscript at this occurrence; the later quotient retains it.')
    r('i.e.','i. e.','specialization explanation','The abbreviation contains a space.')
